(6104361, 899426, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and light.  Cold maybe be a bit sharper on the unfurling bit.</td>', 'Like the composition and light.  Cold maybe be a bit sharper on the unfurling bit.', '2010-07-26 09:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
