(6104436, 898340, 115644, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Summertime Meal to me!</td>', 'Looks like a Summertime Meal to me!', '2010-07-26 10:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6104438, 899090, 22392, '<td valign="top">Seems like the blur has been done in post-processing, not by using a shallow DOF. I wouldn´t mind that much, but it gets a bit distracting that the sand gets sharper on the edges. But I like the little fellow, especially those crazy eyes.<br/> <br/>Added comment: realizing that this is really the effect of a DOF and not post-processing this becomes quite an interesting picture, because it plays tricks with your mind. My criteria in rating this challenge is whether the DOF actually adds something to the picture, rather than just being a side effect. Since in your shot it does make a very unique shot, with an extreme focus on the eyes he is sticking out of the hole, I upped the score. But it is a shot you have to look at a bit longer than most of the others to realize what´s going on.</td>', 'Seems like the blur has been done in post-processing, not by using a shallow DOF. I wouldn´t mind that much, but it gets a bit distracting that the sand gets sharper on the edges. But I like the little fellow, especially those crazy eyes. Added comment: realizing that this is really the effect of a DOF and not post-processing this becomes quite an interesting picture, because it plays tricks with your mind. My criteria in rating this challenge is whether the DOF actually adds something to the picture, rather than just being a side effect. Since in your shot it does make a very unique shot, with an extreme focus on the eyes he is sticking out of the hole, I upped the score. But it is a shot you have to look at a bit longer than most of the others to realize what´s going on.', '2010-07-26 10:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6104447, 898962, 51269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful specimen but a bit over saturated for me -nicely composed</td>', 'Beautiful specimen but a bit over saturated for me -nicely composed', '2010-07-26 10:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6104452, 899609, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the buds/flower in various stages of development, and the colors are not overdone.  That particular type of flower is just so showy, though, that it rather overpowers the buds, even being OOF.  I like it, but I''d probably prefer it with most of the open flower cropped out.  JMO.</td>', 'I like the idea of the buds/flower in various stages of development, and the colors are not overdone.  That particular type of flower is just so showy, though, that it rather overpowers the buds, even being OOF.  I like it, but I''d probably prefer it with most of the open flower cropped out.  JMO.', '2010-07-26 10:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6104454, 899196, 65234, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve used that title before ;-)  Pretty colors.  I''d probably prefer that the main flower not have OOF foreground areas, but I''m rarely a fan of OOF foreground elements.</td>', 'I think I''ve used that title before ;-)  Pretty colors.  I''d probably prefer that the main flower not have OOF foreground areas, but I''m rarely a fan of OOF foreground elements.', '2010-07-26 10:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6104456, 899655, 65234, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W emphasizes the DOF isolating the bird.  He looks a bit contemplative.</td>', 'B&W emphasizes the DOF isolating the bird.  He looks a bit contemplative.', '2010-07-26 10:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6104457, 899580, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, a Tufted Titmouse :-)  Love those little buys.  Nice focus on the head.</td>', 'Aw, a Tufted Titmouse :-)  Love those little buys.  Nice focus on the head.', '2010-07-26 10:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6104458, 899031, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like flowers within flowers.  Very dreamy.</td>', 'Like flowers within flowers.  Very dreamy.', '2010-07-26 10:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6104461, 899220, 65234, '<td valign="top">Impressive detail on those eyes.</td>', 'Impressive detail on those eyes.', '2010-07-26 10:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6104464, 899184, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love all the greens.  Bug looks sorta'' cute for a destructive pest.</td>', 'Love all the greens.  Bug looks sorta'' cute for a destructive pest.', '2010-07-26 10:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6104465, 899573, 61396, '<td valign="top">Great catch. I am intrigued regarding the focus plane though (the lady in red is in focus while other objects that appear at the same distance are blurred). I will just wait for rollover to get the details. (not voting)</td>', 'Great catch. I am intrigued regarding the focus plane though (the lady in red is in focus while other objects that appear at the same distance are blurred). I will just wait for rollover to get the details. (not voting)', '2010-07-26 10:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6104471, 898663, 61396, '<td valign="top">You would expect to see some parts of the image to be in razor sharp focus in this challenge, and yet here the overall blurriness (and color palette) gives an underwater feeling, which works just great. (not voting)</td>', 'You would expect to see some parts of the image to be in razor sharp focus in this challenge, and yet here the overall blurriness (and color palette) gives an underwater feeling, which works just great. (not voting)', '2010-07-26 10:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
