(6105082, 899649, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good DoF... You got some good detail showing on the bird. A few critiques for you: Composition and sharpness. The bird isn''t "Tack" Sharp. Also I think the composition could have been more thought out, though I admit there may not have been time. Specifically the bird is not center nor is it place according to rule of thirds. Also the perspective allows the cluttered background to show through making it not real "clean".</td>', 'Good DoF... You got some good detail showing on the bird. A few critiques for you: Composition and sharpness. The bird isn''t "Tack" Sharp. Also I think the composition could have been more thought out, though I admit there may not have been time. Specifically the bird is not center nor is it place according to rule of thirds. Also the perspective allows the cluttered background to show through making it not real "clean".', '2010-07-26 21:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
