(6106213, 898779, 110876, '<td valign="top">I already finished voting and am going back to leave comments.  This one is at the top of my list.  I expect to see a blue ribbon here.  There are some (for lack of a better term) color layers in the back ground.  I hope that is from my laptop.</td>', 'I already finished voting and am going back to leave comments.  This one is at the top of my list.  I expect to see a blue ribbon here.  There are some (for lack of a better term) color layers in the back ground.  I hope that is from my laptop.', '2010-07-27 22:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106215, 899532, 110876, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  After looking at it closely, I see the shadows from relatively harsh lighting.  In this case, it seems to add a nice effect.  Softer lighting would not have been better here.</td>', 'I really like this one.  After looking at it closely, I see the shadows from relatively harsh lighting.  In this case, it seems to add a nice effect.  Softer lighting would not have been better here.', '2010-07-27 22:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106219, 899087, 110876, '<td valign="top">I think that too much is in focus here for a shallow DOF challenge.  The background is blurred,  but there is not enough of it to get the effect.</td>', 'I think that too much is in focus here for a shallow DOF challenge.  The background is blurred,  but there is not enough of it to get the effect.', '2010-07-27 22:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106222, 898745, 110876, '<td valign="top">The shininess of the wire might be working against you here.  Multiple wires are reflected in each wire making the in-focus portion look OOF or like the camera is shaking.</td>', 'The shininess of the wire might be working against you here.  Multiple wires are reflected in each wire making the in-focus portion look OOF or like the camera is shaking.', '2010-07-27 22:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6106233, 899623, 64929, '<td valign="top">Best dragonfly shot of the challenge!  LOVE the warm colors!  Instant FAV!  Would have liked for you to select a title....I''ll name it...."Fabulous!"</td>', 'Best dragonfly shot of the challenge!  LOVE the warm colors!  Instant FAV!  Would have liked for you to select a title....I''ll name it...."Fabulous!"', '2010-07-27 22:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
