(6106769, 899143, 110876, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the foreground and background subjects closer together, possibly overlapping.  The aspect ratio is so wide, the two seem disconnected.</td>', 'I would have liked to see the foreground and background subjects closer together, possibly overlapping.  The aspect ratio is so wide, the two seem disconnected.', '2010-07-28 06:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
