(6108480, 899623, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail on that body.  Looks a bit tonemapped but I think that works here, though I might fade it out more on the background bits so the shapes are softer there.</td>', 'Lovely detail on that body.  Looks a bit tonemapped but I think that works here, though I might fade it out more on the background bits so the shapes are softer there.', '2010-07-29 11:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108481, 899507, 114429, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and composition...If I could vote I''d give you a 10.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and composition...If I could vote I''d give you a 10.', '2010-07-29 11:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108605, 899637, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Looks like it''s hovering above the ground. The slight fisheye appearance works well for this. However, though the background is *slightly* out of focus, I think this is not really fitting the challenge theme. As far back as those mountains and trees are, the DOF isn''t really shallow at all, and what there is of the effect is not being used in a manner that adds any interest to the composition. The effect seems minor and incidental, so I expect you are getting creamed big time with DNMC votes.</td>', 'Very cool shot. Looks like it''s hovering above the ground. The slight fisheye appearance works well for this. However, though the background is *slightly* out of focus, I think this is not really fitting the challenge theme. As far back as those mountains and trees are, the DOF isn''t really shallow at all, and what there is of the effect is not being used in a manner that adds any interest to the composition. The effect seems minor and incidental, so I expect you are getting creamed big time with DNMC votes.', '2010-07-29 14:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
