(6111333, 899637, 12674, '<td valign="top">Neat car and perspective!  But depth of field seems pretty deep, not shallow at all.  Try zooming in more and using the widest possible aperture on your camera.  That will throw more of the background out of focus.</td>', 'Neat car and perspective!  But depth of field seems pretty deep, not shallow at all.  Try zooming in more and using the widest possible aperture on your camera.  That will throw more of the background out of focus.', '2010-08-01 07:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111391, 899493, 67258, '<td valign="top">Beautifully soft; good separation of flowers  - excellent use of a shallow dof.</td>', 'Beautifully soft; good separation of flowers  - excellent use of a shallow dof.', '2010-08-01 10:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
