(6111400, 899212, 67258, '<td valign="top">A refreshingly different take on the challenge.  I like the idea, the technicals, and the basic composition - do feel it would have had more emotional impact and a greater sense of realism if the gravestone was more modern.  The stone you have picked looks old, certainly older than the subject, and it seems that the title is trying to justify that.</td>', 'A refreshingly different take on the challenge.  I like the idea, the technicals, and the basic composition - do feel it would have had more emotional impact and a greater sense of realism if the gravestone was more modern.  The stone you have picked looks old, certainly older than the subject, and it seems that the title is trying to justify that.', '2010-08-01 10:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111402, 898779, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2010-08-01 10:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
