(6112435, 899143, 112620, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is heavy.  What makes a person think of this for a photograph?  It speaks loudly of dark areas many of us don''t want to discuss.  Honestly I can''t rate it.  I''d give it a 10 for what it addresses and it''s technical aspects, and on the other hand, I''d give it a 2 for such a depressing idea.</td>', 'Wow.  This is heavy.  What makes a person think of this for a photograph?  It speaks loudly of dark areas many of us don''t want to discuss.  Honestly I can''t rate it.  I''d give it a 10 for what it addresses and it''s technical aspects, and on the other hand, I''d give it a 2 for such a depressing idea.', '2010-08-01 21:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
