(6112577, 899252, 10785, '<td valign="top">I find that the white on white doesn''t represent a shallow depth of field very well due to the fact that the out of focus area is all white in the background. I just can''t see that much blur due to the use of your aperture.</td>', 'I find that the white on white doesn''t represent a shallow depth of field very well due to the fact that the out of focus area is all white in the background. I just can''t see that much blur due to the use of your aperture.', '2010-08-01 23:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6112583, 899350, 10785, '<td valign="top">It took me a bit to understand the photo with the title. The boxing reference was hard to come by visually... I couldn''t easily tell he was in a boxing ring with what was shown. I thought he was lifting weights at first. I do like the graphics of the tatoo shown and the sports theme. I like the emotion of the face shrouded by the shallow depth of field. It adds emotion. I also like the color or white balance adjustment. The light and shadow is veyr well taken and adds that dark gym ambiance.</td>', 'It took me a bit to understand the photo with the title. The boxing reference was hard to come by visually... I couldn''t easily tell he was in a boxing ring with what was shown. I thought he was lifting weights at first. I do like the graphics of the tatoo shown and the sports theme. I like the emotion of the face shrouded by the shallow depth of field. It adds emotion. I also like the color or white balance adjustment. The light and shadow is veyr well taken and adds that dark gym ambiance.', '2010-08-01 23:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
