(6112841, 899385, 37845, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by paulbtlw:</b></div><hr/><i> Proof that you should always sleep on an image! I came back to this the next day after submission to find that I really dislike this image.<br/> <br/>Tanguera is quite right - too different. I have since done a full black and white which is soooo much better. I had briefly tried it the night before - not sure why I rejected it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am glad you kept this one in the challenge, and I think its a great image. I gave it a 9, and if I could control the ribbons, you wouldve gotten one. Its brilliance is that it is different.</td>', 'Originally posted by paulbtlw: Proof that you should always sleep on an image! I came back to this the next day after submission to find that I really dislike this image. Tanguera is quite right - too different. I have since done a full black and white which is soooo much better. I had briefly tried it the night before - not sure why I rejected it.   I am glad you kept this one in the challenge, and I think its a great image. I gave it a 9, and if I could control the ribbons, you wouldve gotten one. Its brilliance is that it is different.', '2010-08-02 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
