(6112865, 899402, 17507, '<td valign="top">Irene - I was one of your 30 8s. I didn''t figure this was yours; the sepia palette seems uncharacteristic for you, and it''s the unusual treatment of a very popular subject that caught my eye. Congratulations on your ribbon! <br/> <br/><i>edited because I was apparently out of my mind when I commented initially; I thought this was roz''s for some reason. sorry!</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-08-02 01:30:08.</i></td>', 'Irene - I was one of your 30 8s. I didn''t figure this was yours; the sepia palette seems uncharacteristic for you, and it''s the unusual treatment of a very popular subject that caught my eye. Congratulations on your ribbon!  edited because I was apparently out of my mind when I commented initially; I thought this was roz''s for some reason. sorry!', '2010-08-02 01:45:15.000000', '2010-08-02 02:30:08.000000', 0),
(6112866, 899616, 69325, '<td valign="top">this probably falls under the category of the discussion that has taken place as of late. i imagine you got exactly the look you were going for, and exactly the contrast as well. its not often a nude gets a high placing in a non nude challenge. nice work. however in my opinion some art is better appreciated on a wall in a gallery than in a challenge such as this.<br/> <br/>p.s. i keep meaning to tell you this reminds me of those famous nude shots of Marylin Monroe shortly before she died. Again, lovely work Jen.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-08-02 00:47:11.</i></td>', 'this probably falls under the category of the discussion that has taken place as of late. i imagine you got exactly the look you were going for, and exactly the contrast as well. its not often a nude gets a high placing in a non nude challenge. nice work. however in my opinion some art is better appreciated on a wall in a gallery than in a challenge such as this. p.s. i keep meaning to tell you this reminds me of those famous nude shots of Marylin Monroe shortly before she died. Again, lovely work Jen.', '2010-08-02 01:46:08.000000', '2010-08-02 01:47:11.000000', 0),
