(6115434, 899609, 117474, '<td valign="top">I think this scored as it did because... well, from the crop you''d expect the main flower to be in focus, but it''s the little buds to the right of it that are crispiest. the first thing my eyes look at are the large petals, and then I''m a little confused about why they aren''t in focus, and then my eyes drift to the buds. <br/>Crops are things I don''t understand though. They have a tendency to make some look one way and others look another. This is how I looked at the shot. <br/>The DOF is great in it though. Very shallow. But I don''t know if it brought out the... right part due to the crop. Does this make sense? <br/></td>', 'I think this scored as it did because... well, from the crop you''d expect the main flower to be in focus, but it''s the little buds to the right of it that are crispiest. the first thing my eyes look at are the large petals, and then I''m a little confused about why they aren''t in focus, and then my eyes drift to the buds. Crops are things I don''t understand though. They have a tendency to make some look one way and others look another. This is how I looked at the shot. The DOF is great in it though. Very shallow. But I don''t know if it brought out the... right part due to the crop. Does this make sense? ', '2010-08-03 12:32:34.000000', NULL, 0),
