(6116275, 899580, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty nice picture for the bird being faced away from you.  It''s so common to have them this way and usually it''s a case of "too much ass, not enough face", but you capture the birds turned head quite nicely.  I like the bokeh as well and think it provides a good balance for the bird.  As with the others, it looks like you could sharpen just a bit.</td>', 'This is a pretty nice picture for the bird being faced away from you.  It''s so common to have them this way and usually it''s a case of "too much ass, not enough face", but you capture the birds turned head quite nicely.  I like the bokeh as well and think it provides a good balance for the bird.  As with the others, it looks like you could sharpen just a bit.', '2010-08-03 23:06:37.000000', NULL, 0),
